Subject: [PATCH 12/13] =?UTF-8?q?fix(combining):=20chaque=20n=C5=93ud=20d'?=
 =?UTF-8?q?une=20cha=C3=AEne=20ramifi=C3=A9e=20re=C3=A7oit=20un=20buffer?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20vid=C3=A9?=
